%% Sequence Diagram: Cascading Account Deletion — OopsieEats (NutriView)
%% Menampilkan alur penghapusan akun berurutan: Re-autentikasi, Batch Delete Firestore, Purge Supabase Storage, & Auth Delete
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pengguna
    participant ProfileUI as ProfileScreen / Dialog
    participant AuthProv as AuthProvider
    participant AuthRepo as AuthRepository
    participant FBAuth as Firebase Authentication
    participant Firestore as Cloud Firestore
    participant Storage as SupabaseStorageService
    participant ApiClient as ApiClient (Secure Storage)

    Pengguna->>ProfileUI: Tekan tombol 'Hapus Akun'
    ProfileUI->>ProfileUI: Tampilkan konfirmasi & peringatan permanen
    Pengguna->>ProfileUI: Konfirmasi hapus akun

    opt Sesi > 5 Menit atau Provider Google/Password
        ProfileUI->>AuthProv: Minta Re-autentikasi kredensial
        alt Akun Berbasis Google OAuth
            AuthProv->>AuthRepo: reauthenticateWithGoogle()
            AuthRepo->>FBAuth: currentUser.reauthenticateWithCredential(googleAuth)
        else Akun Berbasis Email & Password
            ProfileUI-->>Pengguna: Tampilkan dialog input kata sandi
            Pengguna->>ProfileUI: Input kata sandi akun
            ProfileUI->>AuthProv: reauthenticateWithPassword(password)
            AuthProv->>AuthRepo: reauthenticateWithPassword(password)
            AuthRepo->>FBAuth: currentUser.reauthenticateWithCredential(emailAuth)
        end
        FBAuth-->>AuthRepo: Re-autentikasi Sukses
    end

    ProfileUI->>AuthProv: deleteAccount(password, useGoogleReauth)
    AuthProv->>AuthRepo: deleteAccount(password, useGoogleReauth)

    Note over AuthRepo,Firestore: Tahap 1: Pembersihan Koleksi Firestore
    AuthRepo->>Firestore: get(users/{uid}/meals)
    Firestore-->>AuthRepo: List dokumen meal records
    loop Batch Chunking (Maksimal 450 dokumen per batch)
        AuthRepo->>Firestore: batch.delete(mealRef)
        AuthRepo->>Firestore: batch.commit()
    end
    AuthRepo->>Firestore: delete(users/{uid})
    AuthRepo->>Firestore: delete(profiles/{uid}) [Legacy cleanup]

    Note over AuthRepo,Storage: Tahap 2: Pembersihan Berkas Supabase Storage
    AuthRepo->>Storage: deleteUserFoodImages(uid)
    Storage-->>AuthRepo: Folder users/{uid}/ dan profile purged

    Note over AuthRepo,FBAuth: Tahap 3: Penghapusan Identitas Firebase Auth
    AuthRepo->>FBAuth: currentUser.delete()
    FBAuth-->>AuthRepo: Akun Auth Terhapus Permanen

    Note over AuthRepo,ApiClient: Tahap 4: Pembersihan Sesi Lokal
    AuthRepo->>ApiClient: clearToken()
    AuthRepo->>ApiClient: clearBiometricPreference()
    AuthRepo-->>AuthProv: Akun & Sesi Selesai Dihapus
    AuthProv-->>ProfileUI: Navigasi ke LoginScreen & Reset State
    ProfileUI-->>Pengguna: Tampilkan notifikasi akun berhasil dihapus
